      },
      "message": "docs(process): merge-ready and needs-rework never coexist\n\nA PR never has `merge-ready` and `needs-rework` together. The agent that\nsets one removes the other in the same `gh pr edit` call and comments why.\nAn open change request wins over `merge-ready` of another collaborator.\nReplaces the \"disagreement: no agent removes a label\" text for these two\nlabels in AGENTS.md, merge-ready, review-prs, resolve-conflicts and\nPR-reviewer.\n\nFixes #3382\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
